%% UC-16 — Complete survey (legacy survey module)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Client (Flutter / web)
    participant B as Backend (surveyRouter)
    participant M as MongoDB

    F->>B: GET /api/v1/surveys
    B->>M: find(surveys)
    M-->>B: survey definitions
    B-->>F: available surveys
    F->>B: GET /api/v1/surveys/:id/render
    B-->>F: rendered survey form
    P->>F: Fill in answers, submit
    F->>B: POST /api/v1/surveys/:id/results {answers}
    B->>M: insert(survey_responses)
    B-->>F: 201 response stored
